* **Crisis Text Line:** Text HOME to 741741 to connect with a crisis counselor. https://www.crisistextline.org/
* **The Trevor Project:** 1-866-488-7386 (for LGBTQ youth) https://www.thetrevorproject.org/
* **The National Domestic Violence Hotline:** 1-800-799-SAFE (7233) https://www.thehotline.org/
* **Local Mental Health Services:** Search online for mental health services in your area.
* **Report Suspicious Activity:** If you see something that concerns you, report it to the authorities. In the US, you can contact the FBI or your local police department.

